{"id":304,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"When Aron evolves, its steel armor peels off. In ancient times, people would collect Aron’s shed armor and make good use of it in their daily lives."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"It eats iron ore—and sometimes railroad tracks— to build up the steel armor that protects its body."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"Aron has a body of steel. With one all-out charge, this Pokémon can demolish even a heavy dump truck. The destroyed dump truck then becomes a handy meal for the Pokémon."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"This Pokémon has a body of steel. To make its body, Aron feeds on iron ore that it digs from mountains. Occasionally, it causes major trouble by eating bridges and rails."},{"games":["Y","SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"When it evolves, it sheds the steel carapace that covered its whole body and develops a new one."},{"games":["X","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It usually lives deep in mountains. However, hunger may drive it to eat railroad tracks and cars."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2"],"text":"In order to build up its steel body, it eats iron ore. This pesky Pokémon is known to eat railroad tracks."},{"games":["LeafGreen","FireRed"],"text":"It eats iron to build its steel body. It is a pest that descends from mountains to eat bridges and train tracks."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"A POKéMON that is clad in steel armor. A new suit of armor is made when it evolves. The old, discarded armor is salvaged as metal for making iron products."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Sturdy","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon cannot be knocked out by a single hit as long as its HP is full. One-hit KO moves will also fail to knock it out."},{"name":"Rock Head","hidden":false,"description":"Protects the Pokémon from recoil damage."},{"name":"Heavy Metal","hidden":true,"description":"Doubles the Pokémon's weight."}],"eggGroups":["Monster"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":35,"baseHappine